<main id="main">
<section class="phero"><div class="phero-bg"><img src="/assets/img/photos/roof-damage.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/roof-damage-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/roof-damage.webp 1200w" sizes="100vw" width="1200" height="798" alt="" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" data-parallax="0.1"></div><div class="wrap phero-in"><nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><i aria-hidden="true">›</i><a href="/island-claim-tools/">Claim tools</a><i aria-hidden="true">›</i><span aria-current="page">Roof Pitch &amp; Squares Estimator</span></nav><p class="tag">Free calculator</p><h1>Roof Pitch &amp; Squares Estimator for Insurance Claims</h1><p class="lede">Measurement errors are a common reason roof claims come up short. Use the footprint, eave depth and pitch to estimate true roof area for shingles or metal panels.</p></div></section>
<section class="sec tool-sec"><div class="wrap">
<div class="tool" data-tool="roof">
  <div class="tool-head"><span>Roof pitch &amp; squares estimator</span><i>Shingle or metal</i></div>
  <div class="tool-body">
    <div class="tool-in">
      <fieldset class="plain"><legend class="sr-only">Measurement method</legend>
        <div class="btn-row">
          <label class="check"><input type="radio" name="mode" value="dims" checked> Footprint length × width</label>
          <label class="check"><input type="radio" name="mode" value="area"> I know the footprint area</label>
        </div></fieldset>
      <div class="row2" data-mode="dims">
        <div><label for="r-l">Footprint length (ft)</label><input id="r-l" name="len" inputmode="decimal" value="52"></div>
        <div><label for="r-w">Footprint width (ft)</label><input id="r-w" name="wid" inputmode="decimal" value="30"></div>
      </div>
      <div data-mode="dims"><label for="r-oh">Eave overhang (inches)</label><input id="r-oh" name="oh" inputmode="decimal" value="18"><span class="hint">Island homes often have deep eaves for shade and rain.</span></div>
      <div data-mode="area" hidden><label for="r-a">Footprint area incl. overhangs (sq ft)</label><input id="r-a" name="area" inputmode="decimal" value="1900"></div>
      <div class="row2">
        <div><label for="r-p">Roof pitch (rise per 12)</label><select id="r-p" name="pitch"><option value="2">2/12</option><option value="3">3/12</option><option value="4">4/12</option><option value="5" selected>5/12</option><option value="6">6/12</option><option value="7">7/12</option><option value="8">8/12</option><option value="9">9/12</option><option value="10">10/12</option><option value="12">12/12</option><option value="14">14/12</option></select></div>
        <div><label for="r-mat">Roof material</label><select id="r-mat" name="mat"><option value="shingle">Asphalt shingles</option><option value="metal" selected>Metal panels</option></select></div>
      </div>
      <div class="row2">
        <div><label for="r-wst">Waste factor</label><select id="r-wst" name="waste"><option value="5">5% — simple metal gable</option><option value="10" selected>10% — gable</option><option value="15">15% — hip roof</option><option value="18">18% — cut-up / multiple planes</option></select></div>
        <div><label for="r-pr">Installed price per square (optional)</label><input id="r-pr" name="price" inputmode="decimal" placeholder="e.g. 1150"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="tool-out" aria-live="polite">
      <div class="out-big"><small>Roof squares (before waste)</small><b data-o="sq">0</b></div>
      <div class="out-rows">
        <div><span>Pitch multiplier</span><b data-o="mult">1.000</b></div>
        <div><span>Roof surface area</span><b data-o="surface">0</b></div>
        <div><span>Squares to order (with waste)</span><b data-o="order">0</b></div>
        <div><span data-o="unitlabel">Shingle bundles (3 per square)</span><b data-o="bundles">0</b></div>
        <div><span>Rough replacement cost</span><b data-o="cost">—</b></div>
      </div>
      <p class="out-msg" data-o="steep"></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
<p class="hint">For planning only. Results depend on the figures you enter and your policy’s terms; they are not a quote, an appraisal or legal advice. Default figures are illustrative.</p></div></section>
<div class="wrap layout"><article class="prose">
<h2>The math behind it</h2>
<p>A sloped roof has more surface than the footprint under it. The pitch multiplier is √(1 + (rise ÷ 12)²): a 4/12 roof is about 5.4% larger than its footprint, a 6/12 roof about 11.8% larger and a 12/12 roof about 41.4% larger. Deep eaves, common on island homes, add surface that is easy to leave out.</p>
<h2>Metal versus shingle</h2>
<ul><li><strong>Metal panels</strong> run in continuous lengths, so waste is usually lower on simple gables but climbs fast on hips and cut-up roofs. Estimates should also list trim, ridge, closures and fasteners.</li>
<li><strong>Shingles</strong> are ordered by the bundle (about three per square) plus starter, ridge cap and underlayment.</li></ul>
<h2>Checking the carrier’s estimate</h2>
<ul><li>Find the total squares and waste percentage on the roof page of the estimate.</li>
<li>Differences of more than 5–10% from your result deserve a closer look or a field measurement.</li>
<li>Look for steep and high-roof charges, especially on two-story homes and hillside lots.</li>
<li>Confirm whether the estimate prices full panels or only “repairs” on a metal roof whose panels can’t be matched — see our <a href="/appraisal-specialties/roof-hail-claim-appraisal/">roof claim appraisal</a> page.</li></ul>
<h2>Questions about this tool</h2><div class="faq"><details><summary>What is a roofing square?<svg class="chev" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></summary><div class="a"><p>One square is 100 square feet of roof surface, measured on the slope rather than the footprint.</p></div></details><details><summary>Is a footprint calculation good enough for appraisal?<svg class="chev" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></summary><div class="a"><p>It is a sanity check. Roofs with several pitches, dormers or additions should be measured plane by plane or with an aerial report.</p></div></details></div><h2>More free tools</h2><div class="related"><a href="/island-claim-tools/hurricane-deductible-calculator/"><small>Calculator</small><span>Hurricane Deductible Calculator</span><svg class="ico" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a><a href="/island-claim-tools/claim-timeline-builder/"><small>Planner</small><span>Claim Timeline Builder</span><svg class="ico" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a><a href="/island-claim-tools/appraisal-readiness-check/"><small>Checklist</small><span>Appraisal Readiness Check</span><svg class="ico" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a></div></article><aside class="aside"><div class="box box-call"><h2 class="box-t">Talk it through first</h2><p>The first conversation is free. We’ll tell you plainly whether appraisal fits your claim.</p><a class="big" href="tel:+18445371427">+1 (844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn sun" href="/contact-hawaii-appraiser/">Send claim details</a><small>Mon–Fri 7am–5pm HST</small></div><div class="box"><h2 class="box-t">All claim tools</h2><ul class="box-list"><li><a href="/island-claim-tools/claim-gap-fee-estimator/">Claim Gap &amp; Fee Estimator</a></li><li><a href="/island-claim-tools/rcv-acv-holdback-calculator/">RCV/ACV Holdback Calculator</a></li><li><a href="/island-claim-tools/roof-pitch-squares-estimator/" aria-current="page">Roof Pitch &amp; Squares Estimator</a></li><li><a href="/island-claim-tools/hurricane-deductible-calculator/">Hurricane Deductible Calculator</a></li><li><a href="/island-claim-tools/claim-timeline-builder/">Claim Timeline Builder</a></li><li><a href="/island-claim-tools/appraisal-readiness-check/">Appraisal Readiness Check</a></li><li><a href="/island-claim-tools/condo-deductible-share-calculator/">Condo Deductible Share Calculator</a></li></ul></div></aside></div><section class="band"><div class="wrap band-in rv"><div><h2>Want a professional to check the numbers?</h2><p>Send us your estimate and we’ll review it line by line.</p></div><div class="btn-row"><a class="btn sun" href="tel:+18445371427"><svg class="ico" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1.9.4 1.8.7 2.7a2 2 0 0 1-.5 2.1L8 9.8a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.3a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.4c.9.3 1.8.6 2.7.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.7 2z"/></svg> (844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn line-light" href="/contact-hawaii-appraiser/">Email the estimate</a></div></div></section>
